<title>ITALY: SOCCER-JUVENTUS 2 FENERBAHCE 0 - RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-JUVENTUS 2 FENERBAHCE 0 - RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>TURIN, Italy 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Juventus of Italy beat Fenerbahce of Turkey 2-0 (halftime 1-0) in their European Cup Champions' League Group C match on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Michele Padovano 41, Nicola Amoruso 84.</p>
